Rule 7 (tensor input must have at least one element)
{v_1 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0
>>
Rule 9 (tensor output must have same shape as input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
